WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.091 --> 00:00:12.612
audience watched as Mr.

2
00:00:12.672 --> 00:00:14.874
Chen pretended to take off the chicken's head.

3
00:00:15.774 --> 00:00:18.116
Then he held up a chicken head for everyone to see.

4
00:00:19.176 --> 00:00:22.379
I knew, of course, that it wasn't a real chicken head.

5
00:00:23.299 --> 00:00:26.201
But the little girl in pigtails started to cry.

6
00:00:26.221 --> 00:00:30.184
"It's just a magic trick, Brandy," her mom told her.

7
00:00:31.340 --> 00:00:34.022
"The magician didn't really take off the chicken's head."

8
00:00:35.343 --> 00:00:36.764
While we watched, Mr.

9
00:00:36.844 --> 00:00:39.586
Chen stuck the chicken's head back on again.

10
00:00:39.606 --> 00:00:41.467
"Cluck! Cluck!"

11
00:00:41.888 --> 00:00:42.808
scolded the chicken.

12
00:00:43.769 --> 00:00:46.110
I didn't think it liked being in a magic show.

13
00:00:47.371 --> 00:00:49.473
Everyone cheered and clapped.

14
00:00:50.454 --> 00:00:52.975
Mr. Scary took his chicken back, and Mr.

15
00:00:53.055 --> 00:00:54.777
Chen continued the show.

16
00:00:55.757 --> 00:00:58.499
Next he did a trick with two one-dollar bills.

17
00:00:59.908 --> 00:01:05.551
He cut them both in half, and then he put them back together again.

18
00:01:05.571 --> 00:01:07.752
"Mr. Chen is a really good magician!"

19
00:01:07.792 --> 00:01:08.272
I thought.

20
00:01:09.332 --> 00:01:11.173
For his next trick, Mr.

21
00:01:11.253 --> 00:01:15.075
Chen made a shiny gold coin vanish into thin air.

22
00:01:16.075 --> 00:01:17.476
The audience loved it.

23
00:01:18.256 --> 00:01:18.837
Even Mr.

24
00:01:18.917 --> 00:01:20.997
Scary was starting to look impressed.

25
00:01:21.017 --> 00:01:23.939
"And now," said Mr.

26
00:01:24.019 --> 00:01:26.460
Chen, "for my best and final trick."

27
00:01:27.952 --> 00:01:32.595
He signaled to Josh, who then led Bunch up to the front of the lounge.

28
00:01:32.615 --> 00:01:37.119
"I will make this dog disappear!"

29
00:01:37.139 --> 00:01:41.061
"I can't wait to see this," I thought.

30
00:01:42.022 --> 00:01:45.625
Mr. Chen opened a wooden box and placed it on the floor.

31
00:01:46.685 --> 00:01:49.767
Josh helped his dad put Bunch in the box.

32
00:01:52.289 --> 00:01:52.850
Then Mr.

33
00:01:52.910 --> 00:01:56.032
Chen slid the box under the tablecloth.

34
00:01:57.116 --> 00:01:59.338
I saw Caswell crawl in after Bunch.

35
00:01:59.598 --> 00:02:00.959
Molly had spotted him too.

36
00:02:00.979 --> 00:02:03.842
"Caswell!" she whispered.

37
00:02:03.862 --> 00:02:06.264
"What are you doing under there?"

38
00:02:06.284 --> 00:02:10.507
"I want to see Bunch disappear," said Caswell.

39
00:02:10.527 --> 00:02:14.290
"Come out right now," Molly ordered him.

40
00:02:15.291 --> 00:02:17.913
But Caswell crawled further under the table.

41
00:02:19.895 --> 00:02:21.496
Molly looked at me helplessly.

42
00:02:22.357 --> 00:02:25.299
There wasn't anything she could do without interrupting Mr.

43
00:02:25.359 --> 00:02:25.779
Chen's show.

44
00:02:27.540 --> 00:02:30.042
"The dog is in the box," Mr.

45
00:02:30.122 --> 00:02:30.943
Chen was saying.

46
00:02:30.963 --> 00:02:34.806
"But he will disappear when I say the magic words.

47
00:02:35.267 --> 00:02:36.988
Abracadabra, pow!

48
00:02:37.489 --> 00:02:39.630
Make this dog disappear now!"

49
00:02:40.691 --> 00:02:42.513
Mr. Chen waved his hand.

50
00:02:43.494 --> 00:02:46.816
Then he lifted the tablecloth and opened the box again.

51
00:02:48.698 --> 00:02:52.261
The little girl, Brandy, stood up on her chair to see better.

52
00:02:53.602 --> 00:02:55.484
Sure enough, the box was empty.

53
00:02:56.396 --> 00:02:57.597
Bunch had vanished!

54
00:02:59.317 --> 00:03:00.878
"Bring the doggie back!"

55
00:03:01.338 --> 00:03:02.159
cried Brandy.

56
00:03:02.179 --> 00:03:06.480
"This is the fun part," said Mr.

57
00:03:06.560 --> 00:03:08.201
Chen with a big smile.

58
00:03:08.221 --> 00:03:13.943
"Let's all say the magic words together: 'Abracadabra, click and clack.

59
00:03:14.704 --> 00:03:17.925
Bring that little dog right back!'"

60
00:03:17.985 --> 00:03:20.746
Mr. Chen waved his hand over the table again.

61
00:03:21.887 --> 00:03:24.508
Then he said the magic words, and everyone joined in.

62
00:03:25.712 --> 00:03:28.253
"Abracadabra, click and clack.

63
00:03:28.473 --> 00:03:32.314
Bring that little dog right back!"

64
00:03:32.394 --> 00:03:33.974
Mr. Chen opened the box.

65
00:03:34.514 --> 00:03:35.815
Everyone stood up to see.

66
00:03:38.535 --> 00:03:40.396
But there was no sign of Bunch!

67
00:03:44.177 --> 00:03:45.437
"Where's the doggie?"

68
00:03:45.857 --> 00:03:46.758
cried Brandy.

69
00:03:46.778 --> 00:03:50.299
"Yes, where is the dog?"

70
00:03:50.799 --> 00:03:51.979
a few people echoed.

71
00:03:52.879 --> 00:03:54.900
Josh and Jenny looked mystified.

72
00:03:55.896 --> 00:03:56.477
Even Mr.

73
00:03:56.577 --> 00:03:58.718
Chen looked a little confused.

74
00:03:59.899 --> 00:04:03.121
I had a feeling this was not what he expected.

75
00:04:04.482 --> 00:04:09.185
Mr. Chen finally leaned over and whispered something to Josh, who nodded.

76
00:04:09.205 --> 00:04:11.347
"Ladies and gentlemen!"

77
00:04:11.747 --> 00:04:12.868
Mr. Chen called.

78
00:04:12.888 --> 00:04:16.490
"In a moment you will see the dog reappear.

79
00:04:16.950 --> 00:04:21.233
Until then I will perform another special magic trick."

80
00:04:21.293 --> 00:04:24.716
Mr. Chen took out a ball of string and a pair of scissors.

81
00:04:25.660 --> 00:04:31.122
"I will cut this string," he said, "and chew the two pieces back together again!"

82
00:04:32.143 --> 00:04:35.604
That sounded like a good trick, I thought, but what about Bunch?

83
00:04:37.745 --> 00:04:38.485
How would Mr.

84
00:04:38.565 --> 00:04:39.846
Chen bring him back?

85
00:04:42.987 --> 00:04:43.647
While Mr.

86
00:04:43.707 --> 00:04:47.249
Chen was doing the string trick, Josh rushed over to me.

87
00:04:47.269 --> 00:04:49.410
"Bunch is gone!"

88
00:04:49.630 --> 00:04:50.290
he whispered.

89
00:04:50.310 --> 00:04:54.732
"We have to find him, or my dad's magic show will be ruined!"
